  "description": "If someone asked me what the worst day of my life was, I’d answer without a second’s hesitation. \n\nOn that worst day, when we both thought we were at the top, I ended up having a dream about Yu Seung-Hun, the man who put me through that terrible ordeal. And it was a cheeky dream where he kept pestering me to “put it in myself.” Was that dream the problem? I ended up running into him after two years, in the very place that’s supposed to be the most wholesome. And to top it off, Yu Seung-Hun showed up with his son, who looked like a carbon copy of him. \n\n*“Did I… have a wet dream about him as a dad?”*\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
